            "text": "Only when the layout changes. If walls are moving, plumbing or gas is relocating, or cabinetry is being specified from scratch, that is a design phase and it carries a fee — credited in full toward your construction contract when you build with us. If your layout isn’t changing — same footprint, same plumbing, new finishes — there is no design agreement and no fee: we measure, spec it and quote it. We’ll tell you which one your project is on the first call."
